id: E2026101515323
title: 配置期兼容诊断与模块加载分别验证
trigger_tool: perl|make
phase: configure|testing
error_signature: module load does not exercise import-time compatibility diagnostics
severity: 2
category: configuration, testing, perl
match_keywords: Canary::Stability, import, no import, compatibility diagnostic, advisory, NOPROMPT
root_cause: Canary::Stability的use Module ()只加载模块而不调用import；原始加载测试不能证明依赖配置阶段的真实诊断行为。版本支持提示属于具体API的输出合同，必须与退出状态及目标软件实际测试分别判断。
affected_scope: 带配置期import诊断的Perl模块
verification_cmd: make -j1 test TEST_VERBOSE=1
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: preserve-diagnostics-and-exercise-actual-import
rec_description: 绑定官方模块字节和真实安装位置；保留原始无import测试，新增真实import版本阈值调用并核对诊断；使用文档化NOPROMPT保持自动运行但不设置DISABLE跳过实际检查；分别保留上游、消费者及Harmony私有文件结果，父库仍须另行完整测试。
rec_command: make -j1 test TEST_VERBOSE=1
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: Keep the original module and no-import source test unchanged; verify actual installed import output independently.
